{% from "components/journey-book/macros.njk" import bookView, smallStory %}
<header class="qj-opening"><span class="qj-kicker">Follow Our Journey / Jeff & Vanessa</span><h1>We’re Building<br><em>Our Happy Place.</em></h1><p>{{ journey.config.intro }}</p><nav class="qj-opening-shortcuts" aria-label="Catch up with our journey"><a href="#latest-chapter">The latest chapter</a><a href="#what-were-up-to">What we’re up to</a><a href="/notebook">The Notebook</a></nav></header>
<nav class="qj-doors" aria-label="Two ways into our journey"><a href="/our-story"><div>{{ {mediaId:"media-2747fb85f929",alt:"Jeff and Vanessa together at the cabin",loading:"eager"} | mediaImage | safe }}</div><section><span class="qj-kicker">Who we are. Why this place.</span><h2>Our Story <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h2><p>How we got here, and what Happy Place means to us.</p></section></a><a href="#chapters"><div>{{ {mediaId:"media-5a9267791917",alt:"Vanessa working on the cabin deck frame during the recorded 2025 build",loading:"eager"} | mediaImage | safe }}</div><section><span class="qj-kicker">What happened. What happened next.</span><h2>The Chapters <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></h2><p>The work, the wrong turns, and the life along the way.</p></section></a></nav>
{{ bookView(journey.book) }}
<section class="qj-section" id="latest"><div class="qj-section-heading"><div><span class="qj-kicker">A little more to catch up with</span><h2>Latest in Our Journey</h2></div><p>Dated moments from the recorded story.<br>Not new November reporting.</p></div><div class="qj-pair">{% for c in journey.latestCompanions %}{{ smallStory(c) }}{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="qj-section" id="what-were-up-to"><span id="current-chapter" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="qj-season"><div><span class="qj-kicker">What we’re up to / Our seasonal focus</span><h2>{{ heartbeat.headline[0] }}<br><em>{{ heartbeat.headline[1] }}</em></h2><p class="qj-season-strap">{{ heartbeat.chapter }}</p><p>{{ heartbeat.intro }}</p><p class="qj-date">A few earlier projects for the season ahead. {{ journey.config.sourceDateNote }}</p><a class="qj-text-link" href="/topics/projects">Explore the Workshop <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><a class="qj-season-image" href="{{ storyCards[heartbeat.feature].href | relatedUrl }}">{{ storyCards[heartbeat.feature].image | mediaImage | safe }}<span>A real QBL build, from the story so far <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a></div></section>
<section class="qj-section" id="two-places"><div class="qj-section-heading"><div><span class="qj-kicker">One life / Two places</span><h2>Both are part of<br><em>what we’re building.</em></h2></div></div><div class="qj-places">{% for id, place in journey.config.places %}<a href="/our-journey/chapters/{% if id == 'home' %}at-home{% else %}at-the-cabin{% endif %}">{{ place.image | mediaImage | safe }}<div><h3>{{ place.title }} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>{{ place.intro }}</p></div></a>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="qj-section qj-notebook-strip" id="journey-notebook"><div class="qj-section-heading"><div><span class="qj-kicker">The Notebook / Smaller moments</span><h2>Worth keeping a page for.</h2></div><a class="qj-text-link" href="/notebook">All the little notes <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="qj-note-grid">{% for c in journey.selectedNotes %}{{ smallStory(c) }}{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="qj-section qj-help"><span class="qj-kicker">The story gives it life / The useful part</span><h2>We learned a few things<br><em>along the way.</em></h2><div class="qj-help-pairs"><div><a href="/our-journey/chapters/chapter-28">The trellises left the workshop <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/pages/we-turned-1-cedar-fence-picket-into-two-little-berry-trellises">Want to build one? Here’s how ours came together <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div><a href="/our-journey/chapters/chapter-25">Another try for the city beds <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/pages/diy-olla-watering-system">See the olla experiment. The longer result is still open <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div><a class="qj-button" href="/field-guide">Maybe We Can Help <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
